From d841e93159d216d4d7f996685286926d84294266 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:46:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [rust jpeg] Backport AVX2 row conversion and fused upsampling
 (PR525)

Backport https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/525 at published
head 5dbe923c726ded1405960ecf5ed924034b8412cf, including explicit configured
row dispatch and safe-only build guards.

Rebase onto the existing Chromium ten-patch decoder stack. Preserve
PR505 native rounding in the fused filter. Test dispatch against the
pinned zune-core effective SIMD policy, and select scalar references
explicitly instead of depending on a separate zune-core option fix.
Exercise row and block-only paths; no-SIMD feature builds test scalar
behavior. Adapt cached-dispatch tests without function-address identity.

Bug: 584016785
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
